---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: publishRaisedCapital(totalRaisedAmount)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: sale not concluded
    q_check_refund --> q_set_capital: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not complete
    q_set_capital --> q_emit: totalCapitalRaised = totalRaisedAmount, capitalPublished = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit RaisedCapitalPublished(totalRaisedAmount)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotConcluded
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotComplete

    note right of q_set_capital
        INV-001: capitalPublished prerequisite for publishSaleResults
        INV-002: totalCapitalRaised <= totalInvestedCapital
    end note
